# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This repository -- the public one, on GitHub -- tracks ONE folder:
# Mistborn/render/
#
# The rest of the vault (the design notes in content/, the wiki, the raw
# sources, the build scripts) stays local and private. Ignore everything,
# then re-include only what is meant to be published.
#
# Local and private does not mean unversioned. A SECOND repository, whose git
# directory is .gitlocal/ and which is never pushed anywhere, keeps a history
# of the private files so they can be compared and reverted like anything
# else. See VAULT-HISTORY.md. It is ignored here along with everything else.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# ignore everything
/*

# except these
!.gitignore
!README.md
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
!Mistborn/

# inside Mistborn/, keep the art and the finished files,
# but never the scratch that tools leave behind
Mistborn/**/Thumbs.db
Mistborn/**/.DS_Store
Mistborn/**/*.tmp
